From f1d2ac4863e3fb7d8e66d4384d69a9f27f8fa979 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: REA <rea@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:36:27 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Build with clang-cl: fix code MSVC accepts but clang rejects

Build-only changes, no behaviour change:
- injector::WriteMemoryRaw takes const void* (callers pass string literals);
- Hooking.Patterns.h: constructor parameter no longer shadows the class
  name used in the delegating constructor;
- SFV.cpp: drop a stray backslash ("\\\N"), which is the C++23 named
  escape \N{...} for clang;
- WMMT6/WMMT6R: drop local static copies of FileExists(), identical to
  the one in Utils.cpp. Utils.h already declares it extern; MSVC turns
  the later 'static' into internal linkage (C4211), clang keeps external
  linkage, so lld-link saw duplicate symbols.
---
 OpenParrot/src/Functions/Games/ES3X/WMMT6.cpp  |  8 --------
 OpenParrot/src/Functions/Games/ES3X/WMMT6R.cpp |  8 --------
 OpenParrot/src/Functions/Games/TypeX4/SFV.cpp  |  2 +-
 OpenParrot/src/Utility/Hooking.Patterns.h      | 10 +++++-----
 deps/inc/injector/injector.hpp                 |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/OpenParrot/src/Functions/Games/ES3X/WMMT6.cpp b/OpenParrot/src/Functions/Games/ES3X/WMMT6.cpp
